  "scope": "Thirty-one independently declared real sources retain the original seventeen plus fourteen newly generated JPEG header dimensions on both sides of every n/8 source-scale midpoint. Forty-five actual public ImageProcessor cases compare dimensions, complete BlurHash, success/failure and source lifetime, including fourteen cached-dimension controls. Actual header dimensions govern decoding and resizing. The original 48 internal pixel observations and 28 additional real-source decodes remain full diagnostics.",
